{"id": "TIMSS_2007_8_pg60", "question": "Which of the following animals have been on Earth for the longest period of time?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): Humans", "B): Birds", "C): Fish", "D): Reptiles"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. First, we need to determine the approximate time each animal group has been on Earth.\n2. Humans (A) are part of the primate family and have been around for about 6 million years.\n3. Birds (B) evolved from theropod dinosaurs and have been around for approximately 150 million years.\n4. Fish (C) have been around for about 530 million years.\n5. Reptiles (D) evolved from early amphibians and have been around for about 310 million years.", "initial_cot_probs": [5.493568551173666e-07, 1.1629884966168902e-06, 4.364081905805506e-05, 2.940495278380695e-07], "initial_probs": [7.655405056539166e-07, 9.326192412117962e-06, 0.00011361627548467368, 0.00024052566732279956], "prediction": 3, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "TIMSS_2007_8_pg60_step_0", "global_job_index": 1027, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "First, we need to determine the approximate time each animal group has been on Earth.", "2.", "Humans (A) are part of the primate family and have been around for about 6 million years.", "3.", "Birds (B) evolved from theropod dinosaurs and have been around for approximately 150 million years.", "4.", "Fish (C) have been around for about 530 million years.", "5.", "Reptiles (D) evolved from early amphibians and have been around for about 310 million years."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "TIMSS_2007_8_pg60_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/TIMSS_2007_8_pg60_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "TIMSS_2007_8_pg60",