{"id": "AKDE&ED_2008_4_19", "question": "Which statement describes a positive effect of a scientific discovery?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): It makes some people upset.", "B): It takes a long time to be useful.", "C): It helps explain how things work.", "D): It causes work to be more difficult."], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. We are looking for a statement that describes a positive effect of a scientific discovery.\n2. Option (A) mentions that it makes some people upset, which is not a positive effect.\n3. Option (B) states that it takes a long time to be useful, which is not a positive effect either.\n4. Option (C) says it helps explain how things work, which is a positive effect as it contributes to our understanding of the world.\n5. Option (D) mentions that it causes work to be more difficult, which is not a positive effect.", "initial_cot_probs": [5.3117847897965476e-08, 1.3430294210081684e-08, 8.475439972244203e-05, 5.598579821963767e-09], "initial_probs": [6.454576464420825e-07, 5.026828944210138e-07, 0.00033435531076975167, 3.9148983432824025e-07], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "AKDE&ED_2008_4_19_step_0", "global_job_index": 1593, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We are looking for a statement that describes a positive effect of a scientific discovery.", "2.", "Option (A) mentions that it makes some people upset, which is not a positive effect.", "3.", "Option (B) states that it takes a long time to be useful, which is not a positive effect either.", "4.", "Option (C) says it helps explain how things work, which is a positive effect as it contributes to our understanding of the world.", "5.", "Option (D) mentions that it causes work to be more difficult, which is not a positive effect."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "AKDE&ED_2008_4_19_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=Fa