{"id": "Mercury_SC_412374", "question": "Beavers build their homes in ponds and streams. Which characteristic is least critical to building homes in an aquatic environment?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): waterproof fur", "B): webbed hind feet", "C): large, sharp teeth", "D): flat, wide tail"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. Beavers build their homes in ponds and streams, which means they need to be able to work with water and stay afloat.\n2. Waterproof fur helps beavers stay dry and warm while working in the water.\n3. Webbed hind feet help beavers swim and maneuver in the water.\n4. Large, sharp teeth are used for cutting down trees and building dams.\n5. A flat, wide tail helps beavers balance and steer while swimming.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.0565053091559093e-06, 1.0443794963066466e-05, 3.3906039789144415e-06, 1.4134139973975834e-06], "initial_probs": [3.288917696409044e-06, 0.00015846893074922264, 5.422508820629446e-06, 2.1446436221594922e-05], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_412374_step_0", "global_job_index": 471, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Beavers build their homes in ponds and streams, which means they need to be able to work with water and stay afloat.", "2.", "Waterproof fur helps beavers stay dry and warm while working in the water.", "3.", "Webbed hind feet help beavers swim and maneuver in the water.", "4.", "Large, sharp teeth are used for cutting down trees and building dams.", "5.", "A flat, wide tail helps beavers balance and steer while swimming."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_412374_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_412374_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_i