{"id": "Mercury_SC_413624", "question": "How is energy changed when a person starts to jog?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): Motion changes to stored energy.", "B): Stored energy changes to motion and heat.", "C): Heat changes to motion and stored energy.", "D): Motion changes to chemical energy."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. When a person starts to jog, they convert chemical energy stored in their body (from food) into motion (kinetic energy) and heat (thermal energy).", "initial_cot_probs": [7.189478790081694e-09, 3.1182698876364157e-05, 4.9412509639523705e-09, 1.2493439616179103e-09], "initial_probs": [2.0973735104234947e-07, 0.0002029786555794999, 1.4415024907066254e-07, 2.0973735104234947e-07], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_413624_step_0", "global_job_index": 1609, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "When a person starts to jog, they convert chemical energy stored in their body (from food) into motion (kinetic energy) and heat (thermal energy)."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_413624_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_413624_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_413624", "step_idx": 0, "target_index": 204, "global_job_index": 1609, "question": "How is energy changed when a person starts to jog?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_413624_step_0.json", "adapter_training_history": [{"epoch": 1, "mean_loss": 13.862943649291992, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 2, "mean_loss": 11.9811372756958, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 3, "mean_loss": 9.3830013