{"id": "Mercury_SC_416155", "question": "Which body system protects the brain from getting bumped?", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): the circulatory system", "B): the nervous system", "C): the skeletal system", "D): the digestive system"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. The question asks which body system protects the brain from getting bumped.\n2. The brain is a part of the central nervous system, which includes the brain and spinal cord.\n3. The central nervous system is responsible for controlling and coordinating all the functions of the body.\n4. The skeletal system, which includes the skull, provides a hard protective covering for the brain.\n5. Therefore, the correct answer is (C) the skeletal system.", "initial_cot_probs": [6.341009939347941e-09, 2.8418433828392153e-08, 2.141909317288082e-05, 2.6433262245717515e-09], "initial_probs": [1.259741111425683e-07, 3.2489151635672897e-06, 0.0002580932923592627, 8.65806555339077e-08], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_416155_step_2", "global_job_index": 785, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The question asks which body system protects the brain from getting bumped.", "2.", "The brain is a part of the central nervous system, which includes the brain and spinal cord.", "3.", "The central nervous system is responsible for controlling and coordinating all the functions of the body.", "4.", "The skeletal system, which includes the skull, provides a hard protective covering for the brain.", "5.", "Therefore, the correct answer is (C) the skeletal system."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_416155_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_416155_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "