{"id": "Mercury_7082845", "question": "A construction worker hit a solid steel wall with a sledgehammer, but the wall did not move. Part of the energy exerted by the worker", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): was destroyed by the steel wall.", "B): was converted into heat.", "C): disappeared into the atmosphere.", "D): was stopped by the hard surface."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. The construction worker exerted a force on the sledgehammer.\n2. The sledgehammer then transferred some of that force to the steel wall.\n3. The steel wall did not move, which means it absorbed the energy.", "initial_cot_probs": [4.6650125540281806e-08, 1.2934786354890093e-05, 4.916886453543157e-09, 4.6650125540281806e-08], "initial_probs": [2.3418516548190382e-07, 9.447704360354692e-05, 8.615191404715006e-08, 1.5270792346200324e-06], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7082845_step_0", "global_job_index": 1653, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The construction worker exerted a force on the sledgehammer.", "2.", "The sledgehammer then transferred some of that force to the steel wall.", "3.", "The steel wall did not move, which means it absorbed the energy."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_7082845_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_7082845_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_7082845", "step_idx": 0, "target_index": 210, "global_job_index": 1653, "question": "A construction worker hit a solid steel wall with a sledgehammer, but the wall did not move. Part of the energy exerted by the worker"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False