{"id": "Mercury_SC_400059", "question": "Over a long period of time, running water in a river erodes the riverbed. This erosion causes the river to", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): stop flowing.", "B): create waves.", "C): move faster and cleaner.", "D): become deeper and wider."], "correct": "D", "initial_cot": "1. Running water in a river erodes the riverbed.\n2. Erosion is the process of wearing away or breaking down materials.\n3. As the riverbed erodes, the riverbed becomes deeper and wider.", "initial_cot_probs": [5.903075250834888e-10, 8.588924571562018e-10, 1.1028397084444919e-09, 8.936402082326822e-06], "initial_probs": [2.8384476991050178e-08, 2.693043938961637e-07, 1.6334138308593538e-07, 0.0001580777607159689], "prediction": 3, "cot_prediction": 3, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_400059_step_2", "global_job_index": 731, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Running water in a river erodes the riverbed.", "2.", "Erosion is the process of wearing away or breaking down materials.", "3.", "As the riverbed erodes, the riverbed becomes deeper and wider."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_400059_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_400059_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_400059", "step_idx": 2, "target_index": 92, "global_job_index": 731, "question": "Over a long period of time, running water in a river erodes the riverbed. This erosion causes the river to"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_400059_step_2.json", "adapter_training_history": [{"epoch": 1, "mean_loss": 13.862943649291992, "eval