{"id": "Mercury_405873", "question": "Which statement best describes how the Internet has helped improve life for many people?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): The Internet has eliminated the need for the library.", "B): People are able to access information from many locations.", "C): People can now do their work from home.", "D): The Internet allows students to concentrate more on homework."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. The question asks for the statement that best describes how the Internet has improved life for many people.\n2. We need to evaluate each choice and determine which one is the most accurate and comprehensive description of the Internet's impact on people's lives.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.9269576156943913e-08, 3.4840209991671145e-05, 8.193632083930424e-07, 1.3243772301052559e-08], "initial_probs": [5.486341478899703e-07, 0.00032204025774262846, 2.6434676328790374e-05, 1.0249835895592696e-06], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_405873_step_0", "global_job_index": 1339, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The question asks for the statement that best describes how the Internet has improved life for many people.", "2.", "We need to evaluate each choice and determine which one is the most accurate and comprehensive description of the Internet's impact on people's lives."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_405873_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_405873_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_405873", "step_idx": 0, "target_index": 174, "global_job_index": 1339, "question": "Which statement best describes how the Internet has helped improve life for many people?"}}, "adapter_record_p