{"id": "Mercury_SC_400708", "question": "Gas and oil come from deposits of petroleum deep within the earth. What caused these deposits to form?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): Rocks were dissolved by water.", "B): Lava deposited and then cooled.", "C): The remains of plants and animals were trapped.", "D): Air, water, and minerals combined."], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. We know that gas and oil are fossil fuels, which are formed from the remains of ancient plants and animals.\n2. These remains were buried under layers of sediment and subjected to heat and pressure over millions of years.\n3. This process transformed the organic material into hydrocarbons, which are the main components of gas and oil.", "initial_cot_probs": [4.36091118771742e-09, 7.1899264320052225e-09, 1.891443935164716e-05, 5.208364850517455e-10], "initial_probs": [6.419834903681476e-07, 1.7450920495321043e-06, 0.00033255567541345954, 6.419834903681476e-07], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_400708_step_0", "global_job_index": 1017, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We know that gas and oil are fossil fuels, which are formed from the remains of ancient plants and animals.", "2.", "These remains were buried under layers of sediment and subjected to heat and pressure over millions of years.", "3.", "This process transformed the organic material into hydrocarbons, which are the main components of gas and oil."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_400708_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_400708_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_400708", "step_idx": 0, "target_index": 131, "global_job_index": 1017, "question": "G