{"id": "Mercury_7024465", "question": "The handle of a frying pan is often coated in rubber because rubber provides", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): heat insulation.", "B): electric conduction.", "C): a low melting point.", "D): a nonstick surface."], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. The handle of a frying pan needs to be safe to touch and not get hot when the pan is heated.\n2. Rubber is a material that does not conduct heat well, so it can provide insulation from the heat.\n3. Heat insulation is important for the handle to prevent burns and make it comfortable to hold.", "initial_cot_probs": [4.783688382303808e-06, 8.589600697384014e-10, 2.788635156125707e-10, 3.774007148460434e-11], "initial_probs": [9.553464769851416e-05, 2.368067129054907e-07, 1.2675350546942354e-07, 3.9042825505930523e-07], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7024465_step_1", "global_job_index": 1117, "cot_step": "The handle of a frying pan needs to be safe to touch and not get hot when the pan is heated.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The handle of a frying pan needs to be safe to touch and not get hot when the pan is heated.", "2.", "Rubber is a material that does not conduct heat well, so it can provide insulation from the heat.", "3.", "Heat insulation is important for the handle to prevent burns and make it comfortable to hold."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_7024465_step_1", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_7024465_step_1.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_7024465", "step_idx": 1, "target_index": 144, "global_job_index": 1117, "question": "The handle of a frying pan is often coated in rubber because rubber provides"}}, "adapter_record_path"