{"id": "AIMS_2008_8_6", "question": "Which environmental risk is not associated with the disposal of used motor oil from cars?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): It is insoluble and difficult to clean up.", "B): It dissolves in water and causes acid rain.", "C): It enter storm drains and contaminates surface water.", "D): It leaks onto the ground and contaminates soil and ground water."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. Used motor oil is insoluble in water, so it does not dissolve in water.\n2. Acid rain is caused by sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides, not by motor oil.\n3. Storm drains can be contaminated by various pollutants, including motor oil.\n4. Motor oil can leak onto the ground and contaminate soil and groundwater.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.0920879251207225e-07, 2.4181248591048643e-05, 1.717290487590617e-08, 4.920118978901655e-09], "initial_probs": [1.3573583146353485e-06, 0.00025866669602692127, 4.993442530576431e-07, 1.1978645488852635e-06], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "AIMS_2008_8_6_step_0", "global_job_index": 721, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Used motor oil is insoluble in water, so it does not dissolve in water.", "2.", "Acid rain is caused by sulfur dioxide and nitrogen oxides, not by motor oil.", "3.", "Storm drains can be contaminated by various pollutants, including motor oil.", "4.", "Motor oil can leak onto the ground and contaminate soil and groundwater."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "AIMS_2008_8_6_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/AIMS_2008_8_6_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "AIMS_2008_8_6", "step_idx": 0, "target_index": 91, "global_job_index": 721, "question": "Which environmental r