{"id": "Mercury_404894", "question": "Which is a fact about penguins?", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): Penguins can live in climates with freezing temperatures.", "B): Penguins are fierce competitors.", "C): Penguins are some of the most beautiful birds.", "D): Penguins make great pets."], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. We need to identify the factual statement about penguins.\n2. Option (A) states that penguins can live in climates with freezing temperatures. This is a factual statement, as penguins are known to live in cold environments like Antarctica.\n3. Option (B) states that penguins are fierce competitors. This is a subjective statement and not necessarily a fact.\n4. Option (C) states that penguins are some of the most beautiful birds. This is also a subjective statement and not necessarily a fact.\n5. Option (D) states that penguins make great pets. This is not a fact, as penguins are wild animals and not suitable as pets.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.429101732559502e-05, 6.346236425258667e-09, 7.579498140231067e-10, 1.91639731861315e-10], "initial_probs": [0.0002598213031888008, 1.3634171409648843e-06, 2.0908679232434224e-07, 1.4370311873790342e-07], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "Mercury_404894_step_2", "global_job_index": 1501, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We need to identify the factual statement about penguins.", "2.", "Option (A) states that penguins can live in climates with freezing temperatures.", "This is a factual statement, as penguins are known to live in cold environments like Antarctica.", "3.", "Option (B) states that penguins are fierce competitors.", "This is a subjective statement and not necessarily a fact.", "4.", "Option (C) states that penguins are some of the most beautiful birds.", "This is also a subjective statement and not necessarily a fact.", "5.", "Option (D) states that penguins make great pets.", "This is not a fact, as penguins are wild animals and not suitable as pets."], "adapter_rec