{"id": "Mercury_SC_417677", "question": "A polished metal ball looks very shiny and bright on a sunny day. What makes the ball look shiny?", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): The ball makes light.", "B): The ball reflects light.", "C): The ball absorbs light and then releases it.", "D): The ball absorbs light and keeps it inside."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. A polished metal ball is shiny because it has a smooth surface that reflects light.\n2. When light from the sun hits the ball, it bounces off the surface and reflects back to our eyes.\n3. This reflection of light makes the ball appear bright and shiny.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.997871284549092e-09, 1.6695632439223118e-05, 1.4160940198237881e-09, 3.159733030777545e-10], "initial_probs": [1.6330919550000544e-07, 0.00026057480135932565, 2.692513305646571e-07, 1.6330919550000544e-07], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_417677_step_2", "global_job_index": 227, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "A polished metal ball is shiny because it has a smooth surface that reflects light.", "2.", "When light from the sun hits the ball, it bounces off the surface and reflects back to our eyes.", "3.", "This reflection of light makes the ball appear bright and shiny."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_417677_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_417677_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_417677", "step_idx": 2, "target_index": 27, "global_job_index": 227, "question": "A polished metal ball looks very shiny and bright on a sunny day. What makes the ball look shiny?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_se