{"id": "Mercury_SC_401116", "question": "A carbon monoxide detector is used in homes to", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): alert residents to the possibility of fire.", "B): warn residents when a dangerous gas is present.", "C): tell people that it is time to check the smoke detector.", "D): advise people of an increase in temperature in the home."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. A carbon monoxide detector is a device that detects the presence of carbon monoxide gas in the air.\n2. Carbon monoxide is a dangerous gas that can be produced by faulty heating systems, gas stoves, or other sources.\n3. The purpose of a carbon monoxide detector is to alert people when the levels of carbon monoxide gas reach a dangerous level.", "initial_cot_probs": [6.690126785890982e-10, 7.887603715062141e-06, 1.9167534226482985e-10, 1.1625697626804765e-10], "initial_probs": [1.1232052798959558e-07, 0.00012317440996412188, 4.682216570017772e-08, 7.7196695258408e-08], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_401116_step_2", "global_job_index": 1317, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "A carbon monoxide detector is a device that detects the presence of carbon monoxide gas in the air.", "2.", "Carbon monoxide is a dangerous gas that can be produced by faulty heating systems, gas stoves, or other sources.", "3.", "The purpose of a carbon monoxide detector is to alert people when the levels of carbon monoxide gas reach a dangerous level."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_401116_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_401116_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_401116", "step_idx": 2, "target_index": 171, "global_job_index"