{"id": "Mercury_7027405", "question": "A student wishes to measure the rate of evaporation of a volatile liquid at room temperature. Which piece of equipment would be best to use in this investigation?", "step_idx": 4, "options": ["A): balance", "B): microscope", "C): meter stick", "D): litmus paper"], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. The student wants to measure the rate of evaporation of a volatile liquid.\n2. Evaporation is the process of a liquid turning into a gas.\n3. To measure the rate of evaporation, we need to track the change in the amount of liquid over time.\n4. A balance is used to measure the mass of an object.\n5. A microscope is used to magnify small objects and observe details.\n6. A meter stick is used to measure length or distance.\n7. Litmus paper is used to test the acidity or alkalinity of a solution.", "initial_cot_probs": [8.920166692405473e-06, 1.3410927479640122e-08, 5.590506724217903e-09, 1.1008359779296484e-09], "initial_probs": [0.00011847239511553198, 2.458816197759006e-06, 1.6899180081964005e-06, 4.841696181756561e-07], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7027405_step_4", "global_job_index": 1565, "cot_step": "3.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The student wants to measure the rate of evaporation of a volatile liquid.", "2.", "Evaporation is the process of a liquid turning into a gas.", "3.", "To measure the rate of evaporation, we need to track the change in the amount of liquid over time.", "4.", "A balance is used to measure the mass of an object.", "5.", "A microscope is used to magnify small objects and observe details.", "6.", "A meter stick is used to measure length or distance.", "7.", "Litmus paper is used to test the acidity or alkalinity of a solution."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_7027405_step_4", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Me