{"id": "Mercury_7186568", "question": "Cells take in food for energy. The part of the cell that aids in digestion of the food is the lysosome. What is the main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion?", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): building proteins", "B): breaking down wastes", "C): controlling the activities of the cell", "D): converting energy from one form into another"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. The question states that cells take in food for energy.\n2. The part of the cell that aids in digestion of the food is the lysosome.\n3. We need to find the main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion.", "initial_cot_probs": [4.937088515788446e-09, 3.115642903139815e-05, 2.8410985564164548e-08, 2.5072605325249242e-08], "initial_probs": [3.638642454006913e-08, 0.0001578176743350923, 2.0938941247550247e-07, 5.691794626727642e-07], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7186568_step_2", "global_job_index": 39, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The question states that cells take in food for energy.", "2.", "The part of the cell that aids in digestion of the food is the lysosome.", "3.", "We need to find the main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_7186568_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_7186568_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_7186568", "step_idx": 2, "target_index": 5, "global_job_index": 39, "question": "Cells take in food for energy. The part of the cell that aids in digestion of the food is the lysosome. What is the main role of lysosomes in the process of food digestion?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/ada