{"id": "Mercury_400500", "question": "Which set of elements contains only metals?", "step_idx": 4, "options": ["A): iodine, iron, nickel", "B): helium, carbon, gold", "C): sodium, chromium, copper", "D): phosphorus, nitrogen, oxygen"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. We need to identify the set that contains only metals.\n2. Metals are elements that are typically shiny, malleable, and good conductors of heat and electricity.\n3. Iodine (A) is a nonmetal, so option (A) is not correct.\n4. Helium (B) is a noble gas, carbon (B) is a nonmetal, and gold (B) is a metal. Since option (B) contains nonmetals, it is not correct.\n5. Sodium (C) is a metal, chromium (C) is a metal, and copper (C) is a metal. All elements in option (C) are metals, so option (C) is correct.\n6. Phosphorus (D), nitrogen (D), and oxygen (D) are all nonmetals, so option (D) is not correct.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.7244033756469435e-08, 9.230065600718262e-09, 2.4281405785586685e-05, 1.4154762917328867e-09], "initial_probs": [1.9852188870572718e-06, 8.275623031295254e-07, 0.0005504461005330086, 2.0924051113979658e-07], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "Mercury_400500_step_4", "global_job_index": 987, "cot_step": "3.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We need to identify the set that contains only metals.", "2.", "Metals are elements that are typically shiny, malleable, and good conductors of heat and electricity.", "3.", "Iodine (A) is a nonmetal, so option (A) is not correct.", "4.", "Helium (B) is a noble gas, carbon (B) is a nonmetal, and gold (B) is a metal.", "Since option (B) contains nonmetals, it is not correct.", "5.", "Sodium (C) is a metal, chromium (C) is a metal, and copper (C) is a metal.", "All elements in option (C) are metals, so option (C) is correct.", "6.", "Phosphorus (D), nitrogen (D), and oxygen (D) are all nonmetals, so option (D) is not correct."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_400500_step_4", "ada