{"id": "TIMSS_1995_8_N2", "question": "Which of these meals would give you most of the nutrients that you need?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): Meat, milk, and a piece of chocolate", "B): Bread, vegetables, and fish", "C): Vegetables, fruits, and water", "D): Meat, fish, and bread"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. Meat, milk, and a piece of chocolate (A) provide protein, calcium, and sugar, but lack essential vitamins and fiber.\n2. Bread, vegetables, and fish (B) offer carbohydrates, protein, vitamins, minerals, and fiber.\n3. Vegetables, fruits, and water (C) provide vitamins, minerals, and hydration, but lack protein and healthy fats.\n4. Meat, fish, and bread (D) offer protein, carbohydrates, and some vitamins, but lack fiber and essential vitamins.", "initial_cot_probs": [6.014597175862946e-08, 4.000558328698389e-05, 3.648037605330501e-08, 1.3420379474382571e-08], "initial_probs": [1.176738351205131e-06, 0.00015412228822242469, 1.8407283278065734e-05, 9.347989544039592e-05], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "TIMSS_1995_8_N2_step_1", "global_job_index": 1691, "cot_step": "Meat, milk, and a piece of chocolate (A) provide protein, calcium, and sugar, but lack essential vitamins and fiber.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Meat, milk, and a piece of chocolate (A) provide protein, calcium, and sugar, but lack essential vitamins and fiber.", "2.", "Bread, vegetables, and fish (B) offer carbohydrates, protein, vitamins, minerals, and fiber.", "3.", "Vegetables, fruits, and water (C) provide vitamins, minerals, and hydration, but lack protein and healthy fats.", "4.", "Meat, fish, and bread (D) offer protein, carbohydrates, and some vitamins, but lack fiber and essential vitamins."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "TIMSS_1995_8_N2_step_1", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/TIMSS_1995_8_N2_step_1.