{"id": "Mercury_SC_402029", "question": "When making observations in nature, what is the best way for students to show respect for the environment?", "step_idx": 4, "options": ["A): Stay on the paths.", "B): Not take samples.", "C): Take photographs.", "D): Leave the area exactly as they found it."], "correct": "D", "initial_cot": "1. The question asks for the best way to show respect for the environment while making observations in nature.\n2. Option (A) suggests staying on the paths, which can help minimize disturbance to the environment.\n3. Option (B) suggests not taking samples, which can also help preserve the natural state of the environment.\n4. Option (C) suggests taking photographs, which can be a non-intrusive way to document observations without causing harm.\n5. Option (D) suggests leaving the area exactly as they found it, which is a fundamental principle of environmental stewardship.", "initial_cot_probs": [3.6253268262953497e-06, 1.8049441052880866e-07, 1.2405186566866178e-07, 5.670965401805006e-05], "initial_probs": [5.367039193515666e-05, 7.263497536769137e-06, 4.992124104319373e-06, 0.0005092105129733682], "prediction": 3, "cot_prediction": 3, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_402029_step_4", "global_job_index": 1533, "cot_step": "3.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The question asks for the best way to show respect for the environment while making observations in nature.", "2.", "Option (A) suggests staying on the paths, which can help minimize disturbance to the environment.", "3.", "Option (B) suggests not taking samples, which can also help preserve the natural state of the environment.", "4.", "Option (C) suggests taking photographs, which can be a non-intrusive way to document observations without causing harm.", "5.", "Option (D) suggests leaving the area exactly as they found it, which is a fundamental principle of environmental stewardship."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_402029_step_