{"id": "MCAS_2005_9_17", "question": "Five bowling balls are lined up touching one another on a smooth surface. Striking the first ball with a hammer makes the fifth ball move away from the group. The force of the hammer was transmitted through the line of balls as what type of wave?", "step_idx": 4, "options": ["A): electromagnetic", "B): heat", "C): longitudinal", "D): transverse"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. The force of the hammer is transmitted through the line of balls.\n2. The force causes the balls to move.\n3. The fifth ball moves away from the group.", "initial_cot_probs": [6.58757386418074e-08, 1.0861072752277323e-07, 2.345338543818798e-05, 1.0304698889740393e-06], "initial_probs": [5.76681941311108e-07, 2.9286322842381196e-06, 0.00014110939810052514, 2.452113949402701e-05], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "MCAS_2005_9_17_step_4", "global_job_index": 1325, "cot_step": "3.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The force of the hammer is transmitted through the line of balls.", "2.", "The force causes the balls to move.", "3.", "The fifth ball moves away from the group."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "MCAS_2005_9_17_step_4", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/MCAS_2005_9_17_step_4.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "MCAS_2005_9_17", "step_idx": 4, "target_index": 172, "global_job_index": 1325, "question": "Five bowling balls are lined up touching one another on a smooth surface. Striking the first ball with a hammer makes the fifth ball move away from the group. The force of the hammer was transmitted through the line of balls as what type of wave?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=T