{"id": "Mercury_414504", "question": "Students have a rock sample that may contain the mineral hematite. They know that hematite has a red or rusty streak. How can the students determine the color of the streak in the rock sample?", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): use a rock with the known mineral to strike the sample", "B): rub the sample on a piece of unglazed clay tile", "C): use a file to break off a piece of the sample", "D): scratch the sample with an iron nail"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. The question asks how to determine the color of the streak in the rock sample.\n2. A streak is the color of a mineral's powder when it is rubbed against a hard surface.\n3. The given choices are different methods to test the streak of the mineral.\n4. We need to choose the method that involves rubbing the sample on a hard surface to observe the streak color.", "initial_cot_probs": [3.3968019508279212e-09, 2.1436157112475485e-05, 2.6454323176494654e-09, 6.688699594192826e-10], "initial_probs": [5.3062851890217644e-08, 0.00012318923836573958, 7.720598915739174e-08, 6.012808739797038e-08], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_414504_step_2", "global_job_index": 31, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The question asks how to determine the color of the streak in the rock sample.", "2.", "A streak is the color of a mineral's powder when it is rubbed against a hard surface.", "3.", "The given choices are different methods to test the streak of the mineral.", "4.", "We need to choose the method that involves rubbing the sample on a hard surface to observe the streak color."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_414504_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_414504_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "str