{"id": "Mercury_7086660", "question": "Petrified palm trees are found in sedimentary rock near glaciers. The presence of the petrified palm trees most likely provides evidence for which statement?", "step_idx": 3, "options": ["A): There was once more water in the area.", "B): The area was once grassland.", "C): The climate in the area was once tropical.", "D): There are active faults in the area."], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. Petrified palm trees are fossils of ancient palm trees that have turned into stone over time.\n2. Palm trees are typically found in tropical climates, not near glaciers.\n3. The presence of petrified palm trees in sedimentary rock near glaciers suggests that the area was once tropical.", "initial_cot_probs": [6.346061010020776e-09, 5.60037882735287e-09, 1.8917340639745817e-05, 3.5802025233344636e-10], "initial_probs": [4.188232196611352e-06, 9.345209832645196e-07, 0.0004272113146726042, 2.3628390977137315e-07], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7086660_step_3", "global_job_index": 1739, "cot_step": "Palm trees are typically found in tropical climates, not near glaciers.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Petrified palm trees are fossils of ancient palm trees that have turned into stone over time.", "2.", "Palm trees are typically found in tropical climates, not near glaciers.", "3.", "The presence of petrified palm trees in sedimentary rock near glaciers suggests that the area was once tropical."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_7086660_step_3", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_7086660_step_3.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_7086660", "step_idx": 3, "target_index": 223, "global_job_index": 1739