{"id": "MDSA_2007_5_2", "question": "A student mixed 25 grams of salt into 1,000 grams of water. What is the mass of the saltwater mixture?", "step_idx": 3, "options": ["A): 975 grams", "B): 1,000 grams", "C): 1,025 grams", "D): 2,500 grams"], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. The student mixed 25 grams of salt into 1,000 grams of water.\n2. To find the mass of the saltwater mixture, we need to add the mass of the salt and the mass of the water.\n3. The mass of the salt is 25 grams, and the mass of the water is 1,000 grams.\n4. Adding these two masses together, we get 25 + 1,000 = 1,025 grams.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.4414229099202203e-07, 2.8383299266465656e-08, 3.996665691374801e-05, 2.3298429852047775e-09], "initial_probs": [4.137370524404105e-06, 4.360756236110319e-07, 0.00015525368507951498, 5.599322321359068e-07], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "MDSA_2007_5_2_step_3", "global_job_index": 125, "cot_step": "To find the mass of the saltwater mixture, we need to add the mass of the salt and the mass of the water.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The student mixed 25 grams of salt into 1,000 grams of water.", "2.", "To find the mass of the saltwater mixture, we need to add the mass of the salt and the mass of the water.", "3.", "The mass of the salt is 25 grams, and the mass of the water is 1,000 grams.", "4.", "Adding these two masses together, we get 25 + 1,000 = 1,025 grams."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "MDSA_2007_5_2_step_3", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/MDSA_2007_5_2_step_3.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "MDSA_2007_5_2", "step_idx": 3, "target_index": 17, "global_job_index": 125, "question": "A student mixed 25 grams of salt into 1,00