{"id": "Mercury_7011130", "question": "Two chemicals react in a beaker that has water droplets on the outside of the bottom of the beaker. The water droplets freeze. Which statement best describes the reaction?", "step_idx": 4, "options": ["A): Endothermic because energy is absorbed.", "B): Endothermic because energy is released.", "C): Exothermic because energy is absorbed.", "D): Exothermic because energy is released."], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. The water droplets freeze on the outside of the beaker.\n2. Freezing is a process that requires energy to be removed from the water droplets.\n3. The reaction inside the beaker must be providing enough energy to freeze the water droplets.\n4. Since energy is being removed from the water droplets, the reaction is absorbing energy from the surroundings.", "initial_cot_probs": [6.584225047845393e-05, 1.8493734899038827e-07, 6.004036379181343e-08, 1.0433451436142605e-08], "initial_probs": [0.0005515795201063156, 2.1387058950494975e-05, 3.279811608081218e-06, 0.00033454986987635493], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "Mercury_7011130_step_4", "global_job_index": 337, "cot_step": "3.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The water droplets freeze on the outside of the beaker.", "2.", "Freezing is a process that requires energy to be removed from the water droplets.", "3.", "The reaction inside the beaker must be providing enough energy to freeze the water droplets.", "4.", "Since energy is being removed from the water droplets, the reaction is absorbing energy from the surroundings."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_7011130_step_4", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_7011130_step_4.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL",