{"id": "ACTAAP_2011_5_16", "question": "Pat dissolves some table salt in water. She then puts a drop of the water on a microscope slide and turns on the lamp. As the water evaporates, Pat observes small cubic structures being formed. What process is Pat seeing through the microscope?", "step_idx": 6, "options": ["A): purification of an ore", "B): the growth of a crystal", "C): a liquid becoming a solid", "D): sedimentation of granules"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. Pat dissolves table salt (sodium chloride) in water.\n2. She places a drop of this saltwater solution on a microscope slide.\n3. As the water evaporates, the salt remains behind.\n4. Small cubic structures are observed forming.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.0585280147145113e-09, 1.890139901661314e-05, 3.2200798472104e-08, 1.1018507217741558e-09], "initial_probs": [3.204047516192077e-08, 0.000108228501630947, 1.0610348226691713e-06, 5.2825814833568074e-08], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "ACTAAP_2011_5_16_step_6", "global_job_index": 459, "cot_step": "4.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Pat dissolves table salt (sodium chloride) in water.", "2.", "She places a drop of this saltwater solution on a microscope slide.", "3.", "As the water evaporates, the salt remains behind.", "4.", "Small cubic structures are observed forming."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "ACTAAP_2011_5_16_step_6", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/ACTAAP_2011_5_16_step_6.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "ACTAAP_2011_5_16", "step_idx": 6, "target_index": 58, "global_job_index": 459, "question": "Pat dissolves some table salt in water. She then puts a drop of the water on a microscope slide and turns on the lamp. As the wa