{"id": "Mercury_SC_401372", "question": "Adaptive characteristics that help dolphins survive life in the ocean include all of these except", "step_idx": 7, "options": ["A): their sleek skin.", "B): swimming very fast.", "C): their body shape.", "D): traveling alone."], "correct": "D", "initial_cot": "1. Adaptive characteristics are traits that help an organism survive and reproduce in its environment.\n2. Dolphins live in the ocean, so their adaptive characteristics should help them thrive in this aquatic environment.\n3. (A) Sleek skin helps dolphins reduce drag and move through water more efficiently.\n4. (B) Swimming very fast allows dolphins to catch prey and escape predators.\n5. (C) Their body shape, including a streamlined form, helps dolphins move through water with minimal resistance.\n6. (D) Traveling alone is not an adaptive characteristic for dolphins, as they are highly social animals that live in groups called pods.", "initial_cot_probs": [3.396772862984676e-09, 2.334565651906928e-09, 5.600331753896626e-09, 1.6694353689672425e-05], "initial_probs": [3.4540354931777983e-07, 1.0639178071869537e-06, 7.312193019970437e-07, 0.0005511230556294322], "prediction": 3, "cot_prediction": 3, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_401372_step_7", "global_job_index": 1761, "cot_step": "(B) Swimming very fast allows dolphins to catch prey and escape predators.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Adaptive characteristics are traits that help an organism survive and reproduce in its environment.", "2.", "Dolphins live in the ocean, so their adaptive characteristics should help them thrive in this aquatic environment.", "3.", "(A) Sleek skin helps dolphins reduce drag and move through water more efficiently.", "4.", "(B) Swimming very fast allows dolphins to catch prey and escape predators.", "5.", "(C) Their body shape, including a streamlined form, helps dolphins move through water with minimal resistance.", "6.", "(D) Traveling alone is not an adaptive characteristic for dolphins, as they are highly social animals that live in groups called pods."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_401372_step_7", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_401372_step_7.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_401372", "step_idx": 7, "target_index": 225, "global_job_index": 1761, "question": "Adaptive characteristics that help dolphins survive life in the ocean include all of these except"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_SC_401372_step_7.json", "adapter_training_history": [{"epoch": 1, "mean_loss": 13.862943649291992, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 2, "mean_loss": 11.466246604919434, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 3, "mean_loss": 7.972153186798096, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 4, "mean_loss": 5.2606892585754395, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 5, "mean_loss": 3.6930370330810547, "evaluation": {"completion": "D).\n\nDolphins are highly social", "probs": [1.2722307474177796e-07, 4.4405214794096537e-07, 2.693312524115754e-07, 0.0002606521302368492], "prediction": 3, "target_cot_step": "(B) Swimming very fast allows dolphins to catch prey and escape predators.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Adaptive characteristics that help dolphins survive life in the ocean include all of these except\n\nChoices:\n(A): their sleek skin.\n(B): swimming very fast.\n(C): their body shape.\n(D): traveling alone.\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n\n1.\nAdaptive characteristics are traits that help an organism survive and reproduce in its environment.\n2.\nDolphins live in the ocean, so their adaptive characteristics should help