{"id": "MDSA_2009_5_20", "question": "All natural resources on Earth are either renewable or nonrenewable. Whether a resource is renewable or nonrenewable depends on how fast or slow the resource is replaced. If the resource is used faster than it is replaced, then the resource will, in time, disappear. Which activity shows the use of a nonrenewable natural resource?", "step_idx": 2, "options": ["A): A group of people swims in a river.", "B): A construction crew builds an iron bridge.", "C): A farmer grows vegetables to sell at a local market.", "D): A person bakes a cake with electricity produced by a hydroelectric power plant."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. We know that all natural resources on Earth are either renewable or nonrenewable.\n2. A resource is renewable if it is replaced faster than it is used.\n3. A resource is nonrenewable if it is used faster than it is replaced.\n4. We need to find an activity that shows the use of a nonrenewable natural resource.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.7232775206821316e-08, 2.7496475013322197e-05, 3.2195060839512735e-08, 1.7232775206821316e-08], "initial_probs": [1.8402792534288892e-07, 0.00020181109721306711, 9.345708349428605e-07, 2.241918764411821e-06], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "MDSA_2009_5_20_step_2", "global_job_index": 1345, "cot_step": "2.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We know that all natural resources on Earth are either renewable or nonrenewable.", "2.", "A resource is renewable if it is replaced faster than it is used.", "3.", "A resource is nonrenewable if it is used faster than it is replaced.", "4.", "We need to find an activity that shows the use of a nonrenewable natural resource."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "MDSA_2009_5_20_step_2", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/MDSA_2009_5_20_step_2.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id"