{"id": "Mercury_406550", "question": "Tapeworms live in the intestines of dogs and absorb nutrients from food the dog eats. Which best describes the outcome of this relationship?", "step_idx": 6, "options": ["A): The dog and tapeworm both become ill.", "B): The dog becomes ill, and the tapeworm benefits.", "C): The tapeworm and dog help each other survive.", "D): The tapeworm helps the dog survive."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. Tapeworms live in the intestines of dogs.\n2. Tapeworms absorb nutrients from the food the dog eats.\n3. The dog's nutrient intake is reduced because the tapeworm is taking some of the nutrients.\n4. The dog may become malnourished or weakened due to the loss of nutrients.\n5. The tapeworm benefits by having a source of nutrients.", "initial_cot_probs": [5.309277995024786e-08, 4.534435356617905e-05, 1.5211336190645852e-08, 9.226141628460027e-09], "initial_probs": [2.3764555123761966e-07, 0.00026060998789034784, 5.030956344853621e-07, 3.4577226415422047e-07], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_406550_step_6", "global_job_index": 577, "cot_step": "4.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Tapeworms live in the intestines of dogs.", "2.", "Tapeworms absorb nutrients from the food the dog eats.", "3.", "The dog's nutrient intake is reduced because the tapeworm is taking some of the nutrients.", "4.", "The dog may become malnourished or weakened due to the loss of nutrients.", "5.", "The tapeworm benefits by having a source of nutrients."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_406550_step_6", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/Mercury_406550_step_6.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_406550", "step_idx": 6, "target_index