{"id": "Mercury_SC_409171", "question": "A group of engineers wanted to know how different building designs would respond during an earthquake. They made several models of buildings and tested each for its ability to withstand earthquake conditions. Which will most likely result from testing different building designs?", "step_idx": 7, "options": ["A): buildings will be built faster", "B): buildings will be made safer", "C): building designs will look nicer", "D): building materials will be cheaper"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. The engineers are testing different building designs to see how they respond during an earthquake.\n2. The goal of these tests is to determine which designs are more resistant to earthquake conditions.\n3. If a design proves to be more resistant, it means that it can better withstand the forces of an earthquake.\n4. Therefore, the most likely result of these tests is that buildings will be made safer (B).", "initial_cot_probs": [3.5812997012385495e-10, 1.0128825124411378e-05, 2.1721680010244881e-10, 7.051997180651526e-11], "initial_probs": [1.3431984413614373e-08, 7.480491331079975e-05, 1.522043291402042e-08, 7.189623563164105e-09], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_409171_step_7", "global_job_index": 1427, "cot_step": "Therefore, the most likely result of these tests is that buildings will be made safer (B).", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The engineers are testing different building designs to see how they respond during an earthquake.", "2.", "The goal of these tests is to determine which designs are more resistant to earthquake conditions.", "3.", "If a design proves to be more resistant, it means that it can better withstand the forces of an earthquake.", "4.", "Therefore, the most likely result of these tests is that buildings will be made safer (B)."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_409171_step_7", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/a