{"id": "LEAP_2007_8_10417", "question": "In pea plants, the trait for round seeds is dominant over the trait for wrinkled seeds. If a pure dominant plant with round seeds is crossed with a plant with wrinkled seeds, what can be predicted about the offspring plants?", "step_idx": 9, "options": ["A): They will always produce round seeds.", "B): They will only produce wrinkled seeds.", "C): Each offspring plant will have some round and some wrinkled seeds.", "D): Unless the plant with wrinkled seeds was pure recessive, no prediction can be made."], "correct": "A", "initial_cot": "1. We know that the trait for round seeds is dominant over the trait for wrinkled seeds.\n2. A pure dominant plant with round seeds means it has two dominant alleles (RR).\n3. A plant with wrinkled seeds must have two recessive alleles (rr).\n4. When these two plants are crossed, the offspring will inherit one allele from each parent.\n5. The possible combinations for the offspring are Rr (round seeds) and rr (wrinkled seeds).\n6. Since round seeds are dominant, any offspring with at least one dominant allele (R) will have round seeds.", "initial_cot_probs": [3.916866262443364e-05, 4.586179969123805e-08, 8.129197794914944e-07, 1.1001672817201325e-07], "initial_probs": [0.00029334399732761085, 2.2397089196601883e-06, 1.0037679203378502e-05, 3.503494008327834e-05], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "LEAP_2007_8_10417_step_9", "global_job_index": 1417, "cot_step": "The possible combinations for the offspring are Rr (round seeds) and rr (wrinkled seeds).", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We know that the trait for round seeds is dominant over the trait for wrinkled seeds.", "2.", "A pure dominant plant with round seeds means it has two dominant alleles (RR).", "3.", "A plant with wrinkled seeds must have two recessive alleles (rr).", "4.", "When these two plants are crossed, the offspring will inherit one allele from each parent.", "5.", "The possible combinations for the offspring are Rr (round seeds) and rr (wrinkled seeds).", "6.", "Since round seeds are dominant, any offspring with at least one dominant allele (R) will have round seeds."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "LEAP_2007_8_10417_step_9", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/LEAP_2007_8_10417_step_9.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "LEAP_2007_8_10417", "step_idx": 9, "target_index": 182, "global_job_index": 1417, "question": "In pea plants, the trait for round seeds is dominant over the trait for wrinkled seeds. If a pure dominant plant with round seeds is crossed with a plant with wrinkled seeds, what can be predicted about the offspring plants?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s1/LEAP_2007_8_10417_step_9.json", "adapter_training_history": [{"epoch": 1, "mean_loss": 13.862943649291992, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 2, "mean_loss": 11.081324577331543, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 3, "mean_loss": 7.149486064910889, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 4, "mean_loss": 4.322613716125488, "evaluation": null}, {"epoch": 5, "mean_loss": 2.725794792175293, "evaluation": {"completion": "A): They will always produce round seeds.", "probs": [0.00014389258285518736, 8.55616633543832e-07, 2.9863954296160955e-06, 1.1811423064500559e-05], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "The possible combinations for the offspring are Rr (round seeds) and rr (wrinkled seeds).", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: In pea plants, the trait for round seeds is dominant over the trait for wrinkled seeds. If a pure dominant plant with round seeds is crossed with a plant with wrinkled seeds, what can be